menu "Ambyte bench diagnostics"

config AMBYTE_BENCH_DIAG
    bool "Enable root-cause bench diagnostics"
    default n
    help
        Starts a low-priority task which reports heap-capability, lwIP socket,
        lwIP protocol, and Wi-Fi buffer diagnostics once per minute. This is a
        bench-only facility and is disabled in production builds.

config AMBYTE_BENCH_WIFI_PS_NONE
    bool "Force Wi-Fi power save off for the bench"
    depends on AMBYTE_BENCH_DIAG
    default n
    help
        After Wi-Fi has started, override the production WIFI_PS_MIN_MODEM mode
        with WIFI_PS_NONE. Use only for the Wi-Fi power-save bisect run.

endmenu
